  "bio": "Step into the legendary Pair-A-Dice Tattoo, the venerable Las Vegas institution where ink meets history. Renowned for their mastery in illustrative and black & gray styles, this iconic studio has been etching Vegas style onto the skin of the bold since 1981. Located at 304 East Sahara Ave, it's a temple of artistry where every tattoo tells a story as timeless as the city's own glittering saga.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nOldest Tattoo Shop in Las Vegas\nTattooing Vegas Style Since '81\n304 East Sahara Ave\nLas Vegas, NV 89104\n(702) 931-2884\n\nOldest Tattoo Shop in Las Vegas\nTattooing Vegas Style Since '81\n304 East Sahara Ave\nLas Vegas, NV 89104\n(702) 931-2884",
